      "writtenOn": "2022-11-09T19:16:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These are arbitrary. I didn\u0027t want to leave the members uninitialized, although they should always get overwritten by the backend caps implementation.\n\nAlternately, I can introduce an \"uninitialized/invalid\" enum member and set that as the default value. At least callers can assert on it.",
